 "notes": {
  "harness": [
   "GEO-Bench m-eurosat records the wrong band name for most channels; its README says the Hugging Face data is not regenerated and the mapping must be applied on load.",
   "Corley et al. found that upsampling EuroSAT from 64 to 224 px changes kNN accuracy substantially, so the declared size_rule matters here more than on larger tiles."
  ],
